{"rank": 62, "root": "ضرب", "form": 1, "lemma": "ضَرَبَ", "count": 55, "ayahCount": 51, "share": 0.28, "meaning": {"bs": "udariti, navesti", "en": "to strike, to set forth", "tr": "vurmak, misal vermek", "fr": "frapper, proposer (une parabole)", "id": "memukul, membuat (perumpamaan)", "ur": "مارنا، مثال بیان کرنا", "bn": "আঘাত করা, উপস্থাপন করা", "fa": "زدن، مَثَل زدن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/37beef1a5bdc389146f6.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-vdrb_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes vdrb_1-0{from{transform:rotate(-150deg)}}@keyframes vdrb_1-1{from{transform:none}}.va-vdrb_1 .ra{transform:rotate(-62deg);animation:vdrb_1-0 0.45s ease-in 5 alternate both}.va-vdrb_1 .nl{transform:translateY(4px);animation:vdrb_1-1 2.2s linear both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-vdrb_1.off,.va-vdrb_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-vdrb_1,.va-vdrb_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><rect class=\"q\" x=\"58\" y=\"47\" width=\"28\" height=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/><path class=\"p nl\" d=\"M67 39v8\"/><g transform=\"translate(46 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"p\" d=\"M0 8v14\"/><rect class=\"q\" x=\"-5\" y=\"20\" width=\"10\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></svg> ", "principal": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "ضَرَبَ", "plain": "ضَرَبَ", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/37beef1a5bdc